IMPORT prelude
-- EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC, phase 2 (the run time): the BARRIER.
--
-- `ONCE ALL HAVE` fires its HENCE exactly once, when the LAST member of the
-- cast has acted (spec §3.1, §3.4). Two things follow, and the traces below
-- pin both:
--
--   * the HENCE is anchored at that last completion, not at arming, so its own
--     WITHIN counts from there (R-Q7, §5.1);
--   * the HENCE sees only the events that came AFTER that completion, so an
--     act that predates the join cannot discharge it.
--
-- The cast is drawn from the ROLL — the list the WHO condition tests
-- membership in — read once, when the contract meets its event stream (R-Q6,
-- R-T6: "the cast is evaluated once at arming"). See run-roll.l4.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Landlord HAS name IS A STRING
    Tenant   HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign    HAS signer IS AN Actor
    Deliver HAS who    IS AN Actor

theLandlord MEANS Landlord OF "Ms Ng"
alice       MEANS Tenant OF "Alice"
bob         MEANS Tenant OF "Bob"
carol       MEANS Tenant OF "Carol"
tenants     MEANS LIST alice, bob, carol

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`the tenancy` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t IN tenants
        MUST   Sign (EXACTLY t)
        WITHIN 14
        ONCE   ALL HAVE
        HENCE  (PARTY theLandlord MUST Deliver (EXACTLY theLandlord) WITHIN 5)
        LEST   BREACH

-- All three sign; the third signature at day 9 is the join. The landlord's
-- five days run from day 9, so a delivery at day 13 is timely.
#TRACE `the tenancy` AT 0 WITH
  PARTY alice DOES Sign alice AT 1
  PARTY bob   DOES Sign bob   AT 2
  PARTY carol DOES Sign carol AT 9
  PARTY theLandlord DOES Deliver theLandlord AT 13

-- The same signatures, and a delivery at day 15. The deadline the breach
-- reports is 14 = 9 + 5, which is what shows the HENCE was anchored at the
-- JOIN and not at arming (where it would have been 5).
#TRACE `the tenancy` AT 0 WITH
  PARTY alice DOES Sign alice AT 1
  PARTY bob   DOES Sign bob   AT 2
  PARTY carol DOES Sign carol AT 9
  PARTY theLandlord DOES Deliver theLandlord AT 15

-- The landlord delivers at day 3, BEFORE the barrier fires at day 9. That
-- delivery does not count: the obligation it would discharge did not exist
-- yet, so what is left over is the landlord's obligation, still outstanding.
#TRACE `the tenancy` AT 0 WITH
  PARTY theLandlord DOES Deliver theLandlord AT 3
  PARTY alice DOES Sign alice AT 4
  PARTY bob   DOES Sign bob   AT 5
  PARTY carol DOES Sign carol AT 9

-- Carol never signs. The barrier cannot be achieved, so the LEST fires.
#TRACE `the tenancy` AT 0 WITH
  PARTY alice DOES Sign alice AT 1
  PARTY bob   DOES Sign bob   AT 2
  PARTY theLandlord DOES Deliver theLandlord AT 20

-- The events run out with two tenants still to sign. The barrier has neither
-- fired nor failed, so what comes back is the outstanding member obligations,
-- with their deadlines decremented by the time that has passed. Their HENCE
-- and LEST print as `the join` and `the join fails`: those are the machine's
-- own markers for "report back to the barrier", not anything the drafter
-- wrote. Phase-2 limit: the residual does not carry the JOIN LINE, so feeding
-- it more events would run the members and not the join.
#TRACE `the tenancy` AT 0 WITH
  PARTY alice DOES Sign alice AT 1

-- Without an event stream at all, a quantified obligation prints back as
-- itself: it has not been armed, so its cast has not been drawn.
#EVAL `the tenancy`

-- A barrier's HENCE and LEST belong to the JOIN, not to any member, so they
-- cannot name one: `ONCE ALL HAVE` fires once, after everybody has acted, and
-- there is nobody for `t` to stand for. The type checker binds `t` throughout
-- the rule -- right for a fork, where each member carries its own copy of the
-- continuation -- so this is refused when the rule is run, by name.
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`whose tenancy` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t IN tenants
        MUST   Sign (EXACTLY t)
        WITHIN 14
        ONCE   ALL HAVE
        HENCE  FULFILLED
        LEST   BREACH BY t

#TRACE `whose tenancy` AT 0 WITH
  PARTY alice DOES Sign alice AT 1
